From 16b2900747a3cc7993eeb39d4a8442b432a3fda0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Viktoria Maximova <viktoria.maksimova@intel.com>
Date: Wed, 13 Mar 2024 18:37:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] [LLVM-18] Remove dependency on SPIRV-Headers for
 SPV_INTEL_maximum_registers (#2434)

This fixes #2415
---
 lib/SPIRV/SPIRVReader.cpp             | 10 ++++++----
 lib/SPIRV/SPIRVWriter.cpp             | 10 +++++-----
 lib/SPIRV/libSPIRV/SPIRVEntry.cpp     |  6 +++---
